# Files Vercel must not serve.
#
# Until 2026-09-20 the whole repo was reachable on the production domain:
# https://xana-assets.vercel.app/HANDOFF.md returned the runbook (tenant ids,
# Entra client id, cert thumbprint, admin emails), /supabase/migrations/*.sql
# returned the full schema and RLS, /docs/IT_Manager_Handoff.md and
# /scripts/backfill.mjs were readable, and /scanner-app/test/fixtures/assets.json
# exposed employee names with serials and locations. The only .vercelignore in
# the repo sat inside scanner-app/ and is not applied by Vercel.
#
# Verify after every deploy:
#   curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://xana-assets.vercel.app/HANDOFF.md   # expect 404
#   curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://xana-assets.vercel.app/assets      # expect 200
#
# Keep: index.html, login/, assets/, admin/, summary/, js/, css/, fonts/, api/,
# scanner-app/lib/, scanner-app/*.png, scanner-app/logic.js (loaded by /assets).

*.md
docs/
references/
supabase/
scripts/
backfill/
labels/
images/
health-history.json
.github/
.hermes/
.claude/
.agents/
.opencode/
*.ps1
*.pfx
*.cer
*.b64
.env*

# vendored test fixtures + snapshots (fixtures carry employee names and serials)
scanner-app/test/
scanner-app/assets.json
scanner-app/assets.csv
scanner-app/photo.js
scanner-app/.vercelignore
